  "description": "LIST TASVEG 40 Fire Attributes: LIST product `LIST_TASVEG_40_FIRE_ATTRIBUTES`, statewide. 468,084 features, multi-polygon (EPSG:28355). Built from the 29 per-LGA LIST zips by stacking them, with an `lga` column: this layer has no feature id, so features crossing an LGA boundary stay cut there. Source released 2020-11-04. Data (c) State of Tasmania, CC BY 3.0 AU: cite as \"LIST TASVEG 40 Fire Attributes\" from theLIST (c) State of Tasmania.",
